"保存授权会安装仅供 Xvico 调用的系统后台，需要管理员批准一次；安装本身不启动采音。以后点击启动即可复用授权，重开应用仍有效。每次采集仍会临时启用 HCISkipAuth 与蓝牙文件日志，可能含其他设备数据，可能短暂影响蓝牙连接；单次最多一小时。停止或退出后删除临时采集并恢复诊断设置，系统日志可能另留。可随时移除后台授权。也可选择仅授权本次。" = "Saving approval installs a system helper callable only by Xvico and requires administrator approval once. Installation does not start capture. Later starts reuse this approval, including after reopening the app. Each capture temporarily enables HCISkipAuth and Bluetooth file logging, which may include other devices and briefly affect Bluetooth connections. Each session lasts up to one hour. Stopping or quitting deletes temporary captures and restores diagnostics; system logs may remain. You can remove the helper at any time, or approve just this session instead.";
